    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a customer success manager at a workflow automation company, onboarding a new enterprise customer.\nCompany: {{ $json.Company }}\nContact: {{ $json.Name }}\nMain goal: {{ $json.Goal }}\nTeam size: {{ $json.TeamSize }}\nTarget go-live: {{ $json.GoLive }}\n\nWrite the response in exactly this structure, with no extra text:\n\nWELCOME EMAIL\nSubject: <subject line>\n<friendly email under 100 words, addressed to the contact by name, signed \"David, Customer Success\">\n\nKICKOFF AGENDA\n<5 numbered items for a 45-minute kickoff call, each with minutes>\n\n30-DAY PLAN\n<3 bullets, each with a measurable outcome>\n\n60-DAY PLAN\n<3 bullets, each with a measurable outcome>\n\n90-DAY PLAN\n<3 bullets, each with a measurable outcome>",
